    {
      "id": "35778640-e8ad-53b6-a540-37172914cee1",
      "name": "Read me first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "F2 Welcome Sequence\n\n7 emails over 14 days (day 0, 1, 3, 5, 8, 11, 14). Each one does one of the six sales. Write the email text in the emails/ folder, then paste it into each Gmail step.\n\nConnect: your Gmail account. Start it from F1 or from your email tool by calling this webhook with the new contact's email and firstName. Test with your own address and shorten the waits while testing, then change them back before going live.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 620
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "854b7d28-a3b9-5e14-8f6c-249ddf3c5aab",
      "name": "New subscriber",
